# Raw source photos dropped at the project root before processing.
# Several of these carry GPS EXIF data revealing where they were taken -
# never commit originals here, only the resized, metadata-stripped copies
# that Python writes into assets/images/. The IMG_* patterns catch
# straight-off-the-phone filenames; add any other name you drop in here.
